@*
    The app shell. Header, page, footer — a flex column so a short page still pins the
    footer to the bottom of the viewport rather than leaving it floating mid-screen.

    The header and footer render before the catalog exists and hold their final heights, so
    the only thing that changes when the snapshot lands is the content of the grid.
*@
@inherits LayoutComponentBase

<div class="vc-page">
    <SiteHeader />

    <main class="vc-main" id="main">
        <div class="vc-container">
            @Body
        </div>
    </main>

    <SiteFooter />
</div>

@* Outside the page column: the drawer is fixed to the viewport, and mounting it once here
   means the cart survives navigation between products instead of being torn down with the
   page that opened it. *@
<CartDrawer />
